esses.\n\n**Skills**\n\n* **Programming Languages:** Python (Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn), SQL, R\n* **Data Visualization:** Tableau, Power BI, matplotlib, seaborn\n* **Databases:** MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQL Server\n* **Statistical Modeling:** Regression analysis, hypothesis testing, time series analysis\n* **ETL Tools:** Apache Airflow, Informatica\n* **Cloud Computing:** AWS (S3, EC2)\n* **Data Mining**\n* **Data Cleaning**\n* **Data Storytelling**\n* **Strong Communication**\n* **Problem Solving**\n* **Teamwork**\n\n**Education**\n\n**Master of Science in Data Science | University of California, Berkeley | Berkeley, CA | 2016**\n\n**Bachelor of Science in Mathematics | University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign | Urbana, IL | 2014**\n\n**Certifications**\n\n* AWS Certified Data Analytics – Specialty\n\n\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -1.3532521724700928}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.0004981707315891981}, {"token": "Mat", "logprob": -4.887569048150908e-06}, {"token": "thias", "logprob": -4.005352093372494e-05}, {"token": "▁Al", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "giers", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "**", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -1.1920922133867862e-06}, {"token": "(", "logprob": -4.792098479811102e-05}, {"token": "5", "logprob": -1.1162972450256348}, {"token": "5", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "5", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -3.6954811548639555e-06}, {"token": "▁", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -7.486063259420916e-05}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -3.933898824470816e-06}, {"token": "3", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "-", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "4", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "5", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "6", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "7", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁|", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁mat", "logprob": -4.8636207793606445e-05}, {"token": "thias", "logprob": -0.00014888131408952177}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -2.026555876000202